cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on ECHO_LabDaemon, please cite it as below and credit Clawdmeter, which inspired it."
type: software
title: "ECHO_LabDaemon"
abstract: "A 4 inch desk screen for the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4 that shows Claude Code usage, the playing track with a dancing creature, notifications and host pages driven by the LabDaemon Engine, a Windows service with a browser dashboard and an MCP server. Created and designed by Digital Orukami, inspired by Clawdmeter by Hermann Bjorgvin."
authors:
  - family-names: Orukami
    given-names: Digital
date-released: 2026-09-27
url: "https://chalulabottle.github.io/ECHO_LabDaemon/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChalulaBottle/ECHO_LabDaemon"
keywords:
  - ESP32-S3
  - Claude Code
  - desk display
  - MCP
  - Protocol 973
references:
